WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.690
Heaven is trying to force 
"ecstasy" upon William.

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.130
His human personality will vanish,

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.820
and he'll simply turn into 
another of Heaven's pawns.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:13.820
They're all nuisances...

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.440
Demons and humans alike.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.740
Time for a change of plan.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.510
I'll send her.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:28.310
They once called me a witch.

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:32.670
For you, Holy Michael, I would go anywhere.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:39.170
Saint Michael the Archangel, 
defend us in battle.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.820
Grant us victory against the 
schemes of the demons.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.020
Jeanne is on her way!

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.870
Kevin, are you there?

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.210
I'll come back later.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:37.810
This is...

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:43.230
The ring my father 
was so protective of...

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.320
What's it doing here?

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.040
Young Master?

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:51.100
Ah, Kevin.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:52.860
Perfect timing.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.650
What can I do for you?

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:57.150
It's about my tuition situation, actually...

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.460
I'm flat broke.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.240
That response came way too fast!

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:04.570
Well, if you'd come last week,
I could've helped a little,

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:08.250
but this weekend I went double 
or nothing, and I got nothing.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.000
You're still gambling?

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:14.350
Oh, right. Would you care for some tea?

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.460
Good lord...

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:20.170
When did he turn into this?

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:24.040
He used to be much more serious.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.450
More polite.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.310
Kinder.

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.450
<i>It was a horrific accident,</i>

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:34.730
<i>yet the boy somehow 
survived without a scratch.</i>

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.650
<i>Look, he's not even crying.</i>

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.920
<i>Holding back your tears is not a crime.</i>

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:53.690
<i>But there's nobody here now.</i>

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:57.210
<i>You don't need to act brave anymore,</i>

00:03:57.810 --> 00:03:58.880
<i>Young Master.</i>

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.360
<i>I...</i>

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:08.060
<i>I was the one who demanded we go out!</i>

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:09.150
<i>That's why they...</i>

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:20.400
Are you okay?

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.360
I'm sorry, my hand slipped.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.640
Did you get cut?

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:25.550
Don't worry about me.

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:30.840
Young Master, you should 
head back to your dorm.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.160
Sure...

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:35.270
Kevin, you don't look so good.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.170
It's just your imagination.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.510
If you say so...

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:44.580
Young Master, please be careful.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:48.890
What are you talking about? 
If anyone needs to be careful, it's you.

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:51.990
You're right.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:58.550
For pity's sake, why should I have to 
worry about my own house steward?

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.270
It should be the other way around.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.730
Well, I snuck the ring out...

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:12.000
This takes me back.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.040
William!

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:16.540
Wow, strange to see you all together.

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.320
What's wrong?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.170
So...

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.480
Was that intentional?

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.920
Why did you send him back to his dorm?

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:34.260
What were you warning him about?

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.290
And why did you let him take the ring?

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.160
Was it all intentional?

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.550
C'mon, answer me.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:48.280
I...

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.690
You're the one who will suffer, you know.

00:05:53.690 --> 00:05:55.580
You realized I was here, didn't you?

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.540
What I started earlier

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:02.230
startled you so badly, 
you dropped the teacup.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:05.760
Going back to Hell?

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.720
Yeah, there's been an emergency.

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.090
Emergency?

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.470
We won't be gone long. Don't worry.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.920
What? I'm not worried about 
a bunch of stupid demons!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.180
Be cautious, William.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.270
I'll return as quickly as possible,

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:23.270
but you'll be on your own in the meantime.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:25.930
What was that?

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:28.400
Why is everyone treating me like a child?!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.500
Go on, leave! Good riddance!

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:35.890
Come, Dantalion, there's no time to waste.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:37.470
Right.

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.330
What do I care?

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.840
I've got absolutely nothing 
to do with any of this!

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:47.330
The real emergency here is my tuition!

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:52.040
Heaven plans to invade Hell?

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.460
You got it.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:57.730
I even sent my most prized soldier.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.240
You don't mean...

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.030
The saint of Mont-Saint-Michel?!

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:05.620
Well, if I'm going to divert Hell's attention,

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:07.440
I need to do things big.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:12.200
Of course, I could always handle it personally...

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:16.230
But I'm willing to give you the honor.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:18.410
Now, aren't I a nice guy?

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.750
You must impart William Twining with

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:26.090
Heaven's ecstasy while those 
meddlesome demons are gone.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:31.080
You must make him Heaven's puppet.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.150
And if you fail again...

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:47.480
You will lose your other wing.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:58.470
<i>You were blessed with God's holy powers,</i>

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.710
<i>yet you openly defy His divine will.</i>

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:02.580
<i>This is your punishment.</i>

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:10.210
<i>Why don't you kill the demons?</i>

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.170
<i>Why?</i>

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.760
<i>Sealing them in pillars and making 
them serve you is not good enough.</i>

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.610
<i>I told you to eradicate them.</i>

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:33.030
<i>Have you forgotten who granted you 
your powers in the first place?</i>

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.080
<i>Know your place, Solomon.</i>

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.710
<i>You are but a man.</i>

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:48.180
<i>And you are jealous.</i>

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:50.780
<i>Uriel,</i>

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:53.900
<i>cruel Angel of Repentance.</i>

00:08:55.760 --> 00:09:01.960
<i>Your lot is to obey the laws of Heaven
and to punish us sinners here on Earth.</i>

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.450
<i>But man will repeat his mistakes.</i>

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:08.070
<i>However you may judge him,</i>

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.790
<i>sin will never go away.</i>

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:11.570
<i>So...</i>

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:15.530
<i>Do we even need punishment?</i>

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:19.280
<i>Do we even need you?</i>

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.010
<i>It certainly is incomprehensible.</i>

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:31.150
<i>Man knows he will suffer for his sins, 
yet he continues to transgress.</i>

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:32.540
<i>Like you.</i>

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.660
<i>Foolish sins...</i>

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:41.010
<i>Don't you understand?</i>

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:44.770
<i>It's because they bring us joy.</i>

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.750
They're going all out.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:53.070
To think Heaven would 
proactively strike at Hell...

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:55.690
What's wrong?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:57.320
I don't like this.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:01.030
Why were they so reckless?

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.820
I suspect they're taking 
advantage of the situation.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.860
With His Highness sleeping,

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:10.580
and us yet to choose his replacement, 
this is their big chance.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:14.230
Even so, such an attack...

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.670
I've got a bad feeling.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.100
I'm going back to William—

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.470
Dantalion, Camio!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.930
The army of Heaven is attacking! 
They're coming back!

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.890
What?! Didn't we repel them?

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:31.980
We finally meet face to face,

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.940
Great President of Hell, Camio!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:37.970
Now here's a little lady 
who's going to be trouble.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:40.050
Looks like Heaven is getting serious.

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:45.120
They send a girl known for 
her hatred of bloodshed,

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:48.640
who never drew a sword, 
to the front lines.

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:51.580
Heaven's committing some 
serious transgressions.

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:56.300
It is human blood that I loathe to shed.

00:10:56.850 --> 00:11:00.270
I care not for the suffering of demons.

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:05.230
Every last one of you will be crushed!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.710
Demons, intercept her!

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:13.770
Filthy demons, how dare you 
raise your blades at me?

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:17.210
Know your place!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:19.900
What?!

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.840
That's the power of virginity.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.540
Care for another taste?

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:42.480
<i>Heaven's ecstasy will draw out the soul.</i>

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.750
<i>If I pierce him with the arrow of ecstasy,</i>

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.550
<i>the human personality known as 
"William Twining" will vanish forever.</i>

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.640
<i>Forgive me, Young Master.</i>

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.670
<i>You can scold me in God's kingdom.</i>

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:28.390
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.970
<i>Why isn't the ecstasy taking hold?</i>

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:31.930
It couldn't be...

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:36.140
<i>Because the Young Master is not religious?</i>

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:40.570
<i>Because he's such a staunch realist?!</i>

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.400
<i>Huh? God?</i>

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.280
<i>Just electromagnetic waves and atoms!</i>

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.490
<i>Then, what do I do?</i>

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.700
You'll have to kill him.

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:51.400
Raguel?

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.920
Holy Uriel, forgive my impertinence,

00:12:56.530 --> 00:13:00.630
but you will be in grave danger if 
you do not carry out your task.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.340
Michael is serious.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.050
You must resolve yourself, as well.

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:11.270
Ecstasy or death.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.570
It is time to decide!

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.400
Ah, so that's the story?

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:25.460
I knew there was an ulterior motive 
behind Heaven's sudden attack.

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:28.630
So they're trying to throw 
Solomon into ecstasy, huh?

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:30.870
That's quite a diversion they set up for us.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.210
We have to tell Duke Dantalion!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.910
But Duke Dantalion is...

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:39.340
You two shut up before I 
deep fry the both of you!

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:46.800
As a resident of Hell, I won't 
hand Solomon over that easily.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:52.900
It appears the demons have sent a guard.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:55.320
I will deal with him.

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:58.290
So please, Uriel...

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.220
Ragu—

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.910
Time to get to work.

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:14.120
An angel's crystal barrier...

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:18.060
What a clever little trick.

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:19.250
Silence.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:22.000
I will be your opponent.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:26.510
It seems Heaven only knows how to 
do the same thing over and over.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:30.340
Steal a human's will, force them to worship,

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:33.470
turn them into a mindless puppet.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:37.480
Yes, just like what you 
did to my beloved Jeanne!

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:43.820
You angels are far more merciless
and cruel than any demon ever was!

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:48.800
Following God's will brings peace 
and happiness to mankind.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:52.350
Ecstasy is but a part of God's will.

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:53.880
Absurd!

00:14:57.810 --> 00:15:00.370
Don't get cocky just yet...

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:05.590
Angels, Heaven, you all disgust me...

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:09.050
I'll kill you!

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:12.970
Gilles de Rais, also known as Baron Bluebeard,

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.470
you would take up arms against 
Heaven even if it means death?

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.350
Yes.

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:20.100
I didn't just kidnap a few clergymen.

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:23.290
I performed alchemy, 
committed numerous adulteries,

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:26.960
and led the slaughter of thousands!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:31.760
I indulged in all of the deadly sins!

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:39.200
<i>You tried to test God.</i>

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:42.510
<i>Did you think if you committed 
every deadly sin,</i>

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:45.420
<i>He'd come to punish you Himself?</i>

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:51.780
<i>And I still never got any 
divine punishment out of it.</i>

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:56.680
<i>Do you really love her that much?</i>

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:01.470
<i>You amuse me.</i>

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.690
<i>I'll make you one of my family.</i>

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:05.300
<i>What?</i>

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:10.530
<i>Die as you are now, and your soul will be
drained away to nothingness in purgatory.</i>

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:15.000
<i>But sell your soul to me
and you'll be a nephilim.</i>

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:16.780
<i>A demon.</i>

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:19.500
<i>And?</i>

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.670
<i>Become a demon, and you'll be able 
to interact with the saints.</i>

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:27.830
<i>I'm told your beloved virgin 
has been canonized as a saint,</i>

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:30.810
<i>and given a place of honor in Heaven.</i>

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:32.880
<i>She'll show herself someday.</i>

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.340
<i>A saint...</i>

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:40.770
<i>What say you? Will you become my pawn?</i>

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.480
<i>Time for the execution.</i>

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:52.820
<i>Abandon all hope, ye who enter here.</i>

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.620
<i>I accept.</i>

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:08.870
What have I got left to fear?

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:11.250
You weren't told?

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:12.130
Told what?

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:15.720
Who's leading Heaven's army into Hell.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.680
Don't you want to see her again?

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:22.640
The saint you once gave your heart to?

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:39.440
I don't know what kind of sentimental 
blubber you expected from me,

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:41.040
but sorry to disappoint!

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:46.250
You think I sold my soul just for the chance to lay eyes upon her one more time?

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:51.500
Yes, of course I want to see her.

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:58.470
Meet her, hurt her, defile her, 
make her scream in agony...

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:03.100
Until she's freed of Heaven's accursed "ecstasy"!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.180
I see.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:07.810
You are, in the truest sense of the word...

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.270
A demon!

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:19.990
And now...

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:24.390
I will pluck off your precious wings.

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:25.950
Halt!

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:28.420
Oh, my.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.790
I see backup has arrived.

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:34.000
I'll cease the ecstasy ceremony.

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:37.970
There's no need to attack Raguel any further.

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:40.840
You mustn't, Uriel!

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:44.260
It's too late for that now!

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:48.690
Raguel!

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:55.230
Oh, I liked that cry of pain!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:59.200
More... Let me hear it some more!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.080
I'm not sure...

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:10.170
if I can hold him off... any longer!

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:31.190
Splendid, just splendid.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.790
Don't die...

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:37.440
until I give you permission!

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:53.630
Dantalion?!

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:57.230
What have you done?

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:03.640
Siding with angels... Have you 
gone insane, Dantalion?!

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:08.770
If you're going to interfere, 
I'll destroy you, too!

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:10.980
Do you want to be eradicated?

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:16.650
Neither your master nor Sytry want that.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.860
Excuse me?

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.770
That is not your business!

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:32.960
Leave.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:37.460
Never...

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.660
Amon, Mamon, get him out of here!

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:43.630
Yes, sir!

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:46.600
Uriel.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.890
Is that your real name?

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:52.240
Never mind.

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:56.980
Whoever you are, to me, 
you're just William's house steward.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:00.330
And you?

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.150
You're just his classmate?

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:08.310
Maybe...

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.710
So you had to stop the ecstasy 
ceremony to save Raguel.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.850
What a convenient excuse.

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:23.790
I warned you what would happen if you failed.

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:29.220
Nothing to say for yourself?

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:35.640
What's wrong?

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.310
Michael? Michael?!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:39.770
Silence!

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:43.160
Leave me. I can't stand the sight of you!

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.950
What's wrong, William? Got a cold?

00:21:53.140 --> 00:21:57.390
Yes, for some reason I woke 
up with my shirt undone.

00:21:57.390 --> 00:21:58.960
That's probably why.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:01.480
I warned you to be careful.

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:05.060
That's what happens when 
you sleep unguarded.

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.150
Stop treating me like a child!

00:23:40.610 --> 00:23:42.010
My name is Jeanne.

00:23:42.010 --> 00:23:44.400
Loyal servant of the Archangel Michael.

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:49.010
Someday I will obliterate all those filthy 
demons in the holy name of the Lord.

00:23:49.010 --> 00:23:49.950
So sit tight until then!

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:51.930
Do you want to be my servant, too?

00:23:51.930 --> 00:23:55.040
Then kneel and kiss my feet.
